      "duration": 6.98,
      "text": "perception, memory, reasoning, and action, working together in a continuous loop."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 7.32,
      "end": 10.58,
      "duration": 3.26,
      "text": "That loop drives agent-environment interaction."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 11.22,
      "end": 15.48,
      "duration": 4.26,
      "text": "The agent observes, decides, acts, and observes again."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 15.98,
      "end": 20.08,
      "duration": 4.1,
      "text": "The three types of agents, reactive, goal-based, and utility-based,"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 20.54,
      "end": 23.54,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "represent increasing levels of sophistication."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 24.38,
      "end": 27.02,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "text": "Reactive agents are fast and rule-driven."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 27.02,
      "end": 29.88,
      "duration": 2.86,
      "text": "Goal-based agents plan towards outcomes."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 30.72,
      "end": 38.72,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "text": "utility-based agents optimize across trade-offs coming up next we're going hands-on in the demo"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 38.72,
      "end": 45.12,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "text": "we'll visualize types and architectures of ai agents in action as so you can see the decision"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 45.12,
      "end": 51.84,
      "duration": 6.72,
      "text": "loops and execution patterns we've been discussing actually running in real time let's take a look"
